  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="HHEBA1CD44839C108D1DAFD6DE3427BE45" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id="HH22FBAEA0509E80B804A4341B1670898A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;"&gt;On July 18, 2018, in Docket No. PL17-1-001, the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (&amp;#8220;Commission&amp;#8221;) dismissed the requests for rehearing and clarification of its revised policy statement on treatment of income taxes (&amp;#8220;Revised Policy Statement&amp;#8221;) and provided guidance regarding the treatment of accumulated deferred income taxes (&amp;#8220;ADIT&amp;#8221;) in light of its revised policy. Inquiry Regarding the Commission&amp;#8217;s Policy for Recovery of Income Tax Costs, Order on Rehearing of Revised Policy Statement, 164 FERC 61,030 (Jul. 18, 2018) (&amp;#8220;July 18 Order&amp;#8221;). Pursuant to the guidance provided by the Commission in its July 18 Order, East Tennessee Natural Gas, LLC, an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of (a tax pass-through entity owned in part by) Spectra Energy Partners, LP, a master limited partnership, intends to remove any balances recorded in Accounts 190, 281, 282, and 283 of the Commission&amp;#8217;s Uniform System of Accounts, as well as excess ADIT that has been transferred to Account 254 and deficient ADIT that has been transferred to Account 182.3. East Tennessee Natural Gas, LLC has requested approval from the Chief Accountant of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission to implement the accounting entries necessary for removing these balances. Upon receipt of the Chief Accountant&amp;#8217;s approval, East Tennessee Natural Gas, LLC will reflect the removal of these balances in the annual and quarterly financing reporting required by Part 260 of the Commission&amp;#8217;s regulations. On November 27, 2023, Spectra Energy Partners, LP ("SEP"), a subsidiary of Enbridge Inc., filed with the Commission in Docket No. AC18-220-000 a request on behalf of certain of SEP&amp;#8217;s pipeline and affiliates, including East Tennessee Natural Gas, LLC, for a Motion for Action on its September 10, 2018 request for approval of accounting entries in this proceeding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock id="HH582A4E700260C05D782FA2D6F218758A" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfMateriallyImportantTransactionsOfTheRespondentNotDisclosedElsewhereTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock id="HHE60759687E403C6B3DE58B8464A791E0" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;On April 29, 2025, in Docket No. RP25-844, East Tennessee Natural Gas, LLC filed a rate case pursuant to Section 4 of the Natural Gas Act and Part 154 of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission&amp;#8217;s (&amp;#8220;FERC&amp;#8221;) regulations. On May 29, 2025, FERC issued an order accepting and suspending the tariff records to be effective November 1, 2025, subject to refund. East Tennessee&amp;#8217;s actual revenues will be subject to the outcome of the pending proceeding in Docket No. RP25-844.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="HHC9E9219375AC2F82A8CDFAF00D88FECC" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Removals, effective 01/23/2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; tab-stops: .5in center 3.25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Capps, Allen C., Senior Vice President &amp;amp; Chief Commercial Officer, GTM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; tab-stops: .5in center 3.25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Huffman, Robert L., Vice President, U.S. Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; tab-stops: .5in center 3.25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; tab-stops: .5in center 3.25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Appointments, effective 01/23/2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; tab-stops: .5in center 3.25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Goff, Diana D., Vice President, U.S. Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -.5in; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: none; tab-stops: .5in center 3.25in; margin: 0in 0in 0in .5in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Huffman, Robert L., Vice President, Commercial Gas Transmission and Midstream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;None&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;NOTES TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; line-height: 15.3333px; color: #000000;"&gt;For the Three Months Ended March 31, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: #000000;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;These&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;interim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;financial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;should&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;read&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;conjunction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;financial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;statements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;thereto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;contained in the Form 2 of East Tennessee Natural Gas, LLC (ETNG), for the year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;ended December 31, 2025. These financial statements are unaudited, but in management&amp;#8217;s opinion, reflect all normal recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of financial position, results of operations and cash flows for the period presented. The results as presented&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;interim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;period&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;necessarily&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 18.4px;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 15.3333px;"&gt;indicative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height