            <tr>
              <td style="width: 99.863%;">
                <p class="MsoNormal">
                  <span style="font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: black; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;">Fuel quantities requiring an allocation are assigned to the rate categories on the basis of the stated fuel rates as referenced in Order No. 710-C, at paragraph 9.&#160; Specifically, within each functional category, the fuel quantities in lines 8 &#8211; 30 are prorated to the rate categories based on the ratio of the Shipper Supplied quantities in lines 1 - 7 for each rate category to the total Shipper Supplied quantity for such functional category.</span>
                </p>
